Gabriela Dotro, Günter Langergraber, Pascal Molle, Jaime Nivala, Jaume Puigagut, Otto Stein and Marcos von Sperling. Treatment Wetlands, Biological Wastewater Treatment Series, volume 7, IWA Publishing, October 2017. [Publisher](https://iwaponline.com/ebooks/book/330/Treatment-Wetlands) · [DOI](https://doi.org/10.2166/9781780408774).

Read the full comparison of horizontal, vertical, French vertical, intensified and free-water-surface systems. Connect treatment mechanisms and hydraulic loading with construction, clogging, maintenance and observed performance. Develop a complete configuration-specific study rather than assuming all planted beds behave alike.

